ISO-10303-21;
/* Tfa004: TWO ADVANCED_FACEs on closed surfaces with no FACE_OUTER_BOUND: face[0] on TOROIDAL_SURFACE with only inner FACE_BOUND (3-edge loop); face[1] on SPHERICAL_SURFACE with only inner FACE_BOUND (4-edge loop); STEP semantics allow entire-surface-with-cutout representation; OCC must insert natural bound before orienting inner wire, not after; both faces wired into OPEN_SHELL — defect is live on face traversal path */
